    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ndimu zya zoma na nsoso",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'awi'laga Mose na Aloni ati', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“V'awi'li V'aizilaeli ati', ‘Mugati' na ndimu zyose i'zyo zili' ha igu'lya na nsi', i'zi hu' zyene muku'v'a muli'lya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki'la ndimu i'yo yi'li' na vyu'ga vya wu'tandu'ke ku' magu'lu', na yi'li'bizu'ka, yeni'yo hu' yene mukowolile ku'lya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninga vyeni'vyo, zili'ho ndimu i'zyo mukasye muv'e muli'lya mugati' na i'zyo zili'bizu'ka du' ninga i'zyo zili' na vyu'ga vya wu'tandu'ke du'. Ntwangawu'lende yi'li'bizu'ka ali'vi yi'li' wu'du'hu' vyu'ga. Yeni'yi' yi'li' zoma ku' winywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpelele yi'li'bizu'ka ali'vi yi'li' wu'du'hu' vyu'ga. Yeni'yi' yi'li' zoma ku' winywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wu'ng'ando yi'li'bizu'ka, ali'vi yi'li' wu'du'hu' vyu'ga. Yeni'yi' yi'li' zoma ku' winywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngu'lu'v'e yi'li' na vyu'ga vya wu'tandu'ke, ali'vi yi'kav'ile ku'bizu'ka. Yeni'yi' yi'li' zoma ku' winywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndimu zyeni'zi zili' zoma ku' winywe. Nhana ku'du' mwize muv'e muli'lya nyama zyazyo ninga ku'zikuumya milambo zyazyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Mugati' na vitundwa vyose vya mu minzi' ga mu nyanza ninga mu myongo, mukowolile ku'lya i'vyo vili' na lu'gaala na magambala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi ki'la ki'tundwa mugati' na minzi' ga mu nyanza ninga myongo i'cho ki'li' wu'du'hu' lu'gaala ninga magambala, mugati' na madale ga vitundwa vido vido ninga mugati' na vitundwa vingi' i'vyo vili'wikala mugati' na minzi', cheni'cho ki'li' igayi'li'zyo ku' winywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'nguno ki'li' zoma ku' winywe, ku'du' mwize muv'e muli'lya nyama yacho, ninga ku'gu'kuumya mulambo gwacho, ku'nguno gu'li' igayi'li'zyo ku' winywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki'la ki'tundwa i'cho ki'li'wikala mu minzi' nacho ki'li' wu'du'hu' magambala ninga lu'gaala ki'li' igayi'li'zyo ku' winywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ku' lwandi' lwa nnoni i'zyo zili' igayi'li'zyo ku' winywe, ku'du' mwize muv'e muli'lya i'zi: nyandakayogo, mbesi, kalimba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nyanda, ki'la mukoli gwa lu'v'ala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ki'la mukoli gwa maku'ngu'u'lu', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nnongu, pu'lu', v'iliv'ili, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nsinhi, munandi', ifunfugu'lu', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nsu'lu'zi, nsinhi ya mu ibalangu', kasinzi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nkololo, ki'la mukoli gwa mwelwe, ku'nda haki'mo na tu'nge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Madudu gose ga manana na gali'yu'mba ha nsi', genago gali' igayi'li'zyo ku' winywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi mugati' na madudu genago, mukowolile ku'lya ago gali' na masanto ga ku'dumu'ki'la ha igu'lya na nsi'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugati' na madudu genago mukowolile ku'lya aga: ki'la mukoli gwa nzige, nsyenene na ndili na ki'la mukoli gwa ntololo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sumbwa madudu gangi' gose ago gali' na manana na gali'yu'mba ha nsi', genago gali' igayi'li'zyo ku' winywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Mulitu'u'li'le zoma ku' ndimu i'zi. Ki'la u'yo alakuumye milambo zyazyo alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu' u'yo alasombe ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo mugati' na mulambo gwa vitundwa vyeni'vyo alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi', na yi'lamudime ku'vikanza vizwalo vyakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ki'la ndimu i'yo yi'li' wu'du'hu' vyu'ga vya wu'tandu'ke, ninga yi'kav'ile ku'bizu'ka, yeni'yo yi'li' zoma ku' winywe. Muntu' u'yo alakuumye mulambo gwayo alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' mugati' na ndimu zyose i'zyo zili' na magu'lu' ane, ali'vi zili' na mawundu, zyeni'zyo zili' zoma ku' winywe. Ki'la muntu' u'yo alazikuumye milambo zyazyo alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu' ninga yu'mo u'yo alasombe milambo zyazyo yi'lamudime ku'vikanza vizwalo vyakwe, nawe alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'. Ndimu zyeni'zyo zili' zoma ku' winywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
