          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ku' lwandi' lwa vitundwa vingi' vya ku'yu'mba ha igu'lya na nsi', i'vi hu' vyene vili' zoma ku' winywe: Lonzi, ngoso, ki'la mukoli gwa mbu'lu', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ku'u'li', isandawu'lu', ki'gonigoni, mbu'lu'wu'lu' na lu'nvu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vyeni'vyo vyose vili' zoma ku' winywe. Muntu' u'yo alazikuumye milambo zyazyo alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' u'lu' yi'v'e mugati' na vitundwa vyeni'vyo ki'mo ki'fwe na ku'gwi'la ha igu'lya na ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo, i'cho ki'lagwi'lwe ki'lav'e na zoma, ninga ki'v'e ki'v'eziv'ilwe ku' muti', mwenda, ndi'li' ninga iguni'la, hangi' ninga ki'v'e cha ku'tu'mami'la muli'mo ninga gu'mo. Yi'li'mudima ku'ki'tu'u'la mu minzi', nacho ki'lav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi', haho ki'lav'e chav'a ki'soso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lu' ki'tundwa cha wu'fwe ki'gwi'le mu ki'seme cha nnungu', hohene ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo i'cho ki'lav'e mwenu'mo ki'lav'e na zoma, na cheni'cho ki'seme yi'lamudime ku'ki'v'ela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki'la ki'liwa i'cho ki'liti'lwe minzi' ga ku'fuma mu ki'seme cheni'cho ki'lav'e na zoma, na ki'la ki'ntu' cha ku'nywiwa i'cho ki'lav'e mu ki'seme cheni'cho, ki'lav'e na zoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki'la ki'ntu' i'cho ki'lagwi'lwe na ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo mugati' na mulambo gwenu'go ki'lav'e na zoma. Yi'v'e liko ninga nnungu' ya ku'tekela, yi'lamudime ku'viv'ela. Vilav'e na zoma, navyo vili' zoma ku' winywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi lwinzi' ninga kasela ka minzi' vikasye viv'e na zoma, ali'vi muntu' ninga yu'mo u'yo alakuumye mulambo u'go gu'li' mu minzi' alav'e na zoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lu' ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo mugati' na mulambo ki'gwi'le ha igu'lya na mbutoo, mbutoo yeni'yo yi'kasye yi'v'e na zoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi u'lu' mbiyu' zyeni'zyo ziv'e zilov'ekilwe mu minzi' na ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo mugati' na mulambo ki'gwi'le ha igu'lya yazyo, mbiyu' zyeni'zyo zilav'e na zoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ndimu i'yo muzumi'ziv'ilwe ku'yi'lya u'lu' yifwi'le, u'yo alagu'kuumye mulambo gwayo alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki'la muntu' u'yo alalye nyama ya mulambo gwenu'go yi'lamudime avikanze vizwalo vyakwe, nawe alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'. Hangi' ki'la muntu' u'yo alagu'sombe mulambo gwenu'go yi'lamudime avikanze vizwalo vyakwe, nawe alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Hangi' ki'la ki'tundwa ki'do ki'do i'cho ki'li'yu'mba ha igu'lya na nsi' ki'li' igayi'li'zyo. Nhana ku'du' mwize muki'lye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki'la ki'tundwa ki'do ki'do i'cho ki'li'yu'mbi'la nda yalyo, na ki'la i'cho ki'li'yu'mbi'la magu'lu' ane, ninga i'cho ki'li'yu'mbi'la magu'lu' mingi, yaani vitundwa vyose i'vyo vili'yu'mba ha igu'lya na nsi', nhana ku'du' mwize muvilye ku'nguno vili' igayi'li'zyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'du' mwize mwitu'u'li'le igayi'li'zyo ku' ku'lya vitundwa vyeni'vyo, ninga ku'du' mwize muziv'ezye myoyo zinywe ku'v'a na zoma ku'nguno yavyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'nguno ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe. Mwisondohye muv'e v'asondo, ku'nguno ene ni' musondo. Ku'du' mwiv'ezezye zoma inywe v'eni'ki'li' ku' ki'tundwa ki'do ki'do ninga ki'mo cha ku'yu'mba ha igu'lya na nsi'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu u'yo namufumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili ki'gele mbe Mulungu winywe. Ku'nguno yeni'yo muv'e v'asondo, ku'nguno ene ni' musondo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Yeni'yo hu' nhama ku'nguno ya ndimu, nnoni na ki'la ki'tundwa cha myu'ye ya wu'panga i'cho ki'li' mu minzi' ninga i'cho ki'li'yu'mba ha igu'lya na nsi'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yi'li'mudima ku'lekania mugati' na i'cho ki'li' ki'soso na i'cho ki'li' zoma, na mugati' na vitundwa vya myu'ye ya wu'panga i'vyo vikowolile ku'liwa na i'vyo vikakowoleka ku'liwa.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
